{
"Items.FineLongsword.Desc": "A fine, elegant longsword, slightly smaller than its brethren. Simple and unassuming at first glance, it actually seems to be custom-made, as an elaborate motif of falcons and lilies is etched into the fittings and scabbard. The blade itself is excellently balanced for anyone looking for a nimble, easy-to-handle weapon."
"Items.FineLongsword.Long": "a fine longsword"
"Items.FineLongsword.Short": "Fine Longsword"
}
